## 4. Product choices recommended for continuity (labeled as choices, not findings)

1. Referenced-original media + content-hash identity + append-only edit journal (lesson §2.1) — **product choice**; the bounded alternative is a unitary single-file project like AUP3, acceptable only with an explicit compaction, locking, and recovery story.
2. Cues anchored in source samples, project positions derived (§V2) — **product choice**; alternative is project-time anchors with mandatory revalidation on any rate conversion (worse, but workable if revalidation is enforced).
3. Cancel ⇒ quarantine partial render + completion record in export manifest (§V5) — **product choice** consistent with §2.2 precedent.

